@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-login-accessToken
@userToken = replace-with-user-login-accessToken
@productId = 1
@orderId = 1

### 1. 管理员登录，密码与环境变量一致
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"replace-with-a-strong-admin-password"}

### 2. 使用管理员 accessToken 创建商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"KEYBOARD-001","name":"机械键盘","description":"87 键机械键盘","category":"electronics","price":199.00,"active":true,"stock":20}

### 3. 用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"Alice-password-123!"}

### 4. 用户登录，将 accessToken 填入 userToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"Alice-password-123!"}

### 5. 商品查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&size=20&category=electronics

### 6. 设置购物车商品数量
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### 7. 下单（重试使用同一 requestKey，新订单使用新键）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestKey":"alice-checkout-0001"}

### 8. 历史订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&size=20&status=CREATED
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. 订单明细
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. 取消订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. 查询实时库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
